  "description": "YUWQUG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H62 Br2 Dy6 N12 O24 6+,6(Br1 1-),2(C2 H6 O1),2(C2 H3 N1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.489-3.503 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.92-97.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(μ3-OH)4(μ2-OH)2(L)Br2(H2O)10]Br6·2CH3CH2OH·2CH3CN·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 10 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
